# Files read by Linux tools (bash, redis-server in a container) must keep LF line endings, also on a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true: a CR at the end of a line breaks a script, and in the ACL
# file it would become part of the password.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.acl text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
